35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The late-turn pool is critically thin. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The mid-city runs are slower, but the platforms aren't more crowded.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The ticketing fees are eating up the paving budget. It's a mess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The previous accessibility work finished on time, but the lane priorities failed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The pre-war shells have hidden voids. Bidders are pricing in huge contingencies.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if we extend hours, we have no spare crew.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, so the physical upgrades work, but the traffic ones don't?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, exactly. The roster books show zero slack.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, yes. The lift rebuilds were solid. The lane changes were reverted.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the financials are tight, but the ground risk is higher.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We cannot promise night service without breaking the maintenance contract.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"The journey audits say waiting is the problem, not the ride.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but it's for construction, not ops.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,The joint operators never agreed on data terms. That's a blocker for integration.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The roadway consents are delegated, which is good for the bus corridor.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
